The Role &nbsp;

Join the UK’s market leading restructuring tax team and make a real difference on a range of high profile and dynamic transactions &nbsp;

Our Restructuring Services Tax team specialises in providing tax advice on the restructuring of financially distressed businesses.&nbsp; &nbsp;

